{
  "description": "Biology lab organism — a photosynthesis-style process-rate simulator (learner adjusts light/CO₂/temperature and watches the rate and limiting factor recompute), a mitosis phase-cycle stepper with predict-before-reveal, an animated breathing cell-structure diagram, an animated food-web ecosystem, and a declarative classification-network render, composed from the std-bio-processrate, std-bio-phasecycle, std-bio-cell, std-bio-foodweb, and std-bio-network instrument atoms behind a mode router.",
